    "Capabilities prose accurately restricts native (MODEL; physical=false) rows to software models actually selected/generated by the current resolver. It explicitly denies physical peripheral counts, pins, IRQs, Board routes and board capability, explains empty route/Board columns and excludes unselected inventory.",
    "All 34 other added capabilities keys per language are technical identifiers, mode strings or source/fixture paths and are preserved exactly. Software RTC0/RTC1 and LPTIM0/LPTIM1 identifiers are not translated into physical-instance claims.",
    "Gallery figure identity is restored to FIG-16, and every other gallery value remains exact. No newly reviewed pair changes units, public symbols, borrowing/SETTLED contracts or hardware evidence boundaries."
